Assets created by this project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every non-source asset bundled in this repository was generated by the
project itself and is covered by the Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE:

  - the nine 3D models under public/assets/models/{characters,environments,props}/
    (geometry recipes: scripts/model-recipes.mjs; generator: scripts/generate-model-assets.mjs)
  - every model thumbnail under public/assets/models/thumbnails/
    (rendered from the model files by scripts/render-model-thumbnails.mjs)
  - the site logo src/assets/images/logo.svg (vector master) with its raster
    derivatives src/assets/images/logo.png and public/favicon.ico
    (rendered by scripts/generate-brand-assets.mjs)
  - the README cover docs/assets/cover.png and the page screenshots
    under docs/screenshots/ (scripts/generate-docs-assets.mjs)
  - the demo recording docs/assets/demo.gif and docs/assets/demo.mp4
    (scripts/record-demo.mjs)

No third-party artwork, model or font is bundled.

